  "description": "The ring-native HTTP client for the ioxide io_uring runtime: HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 behind one API, with the protocol chosen per origin via Alt-Svc. One package - the h1 parser, a pure-C# HTTP/2 client on ioxide.http2's framing, the nghttp3 bridge, client-side TLS (SNI, ALPN and certificate verification) for https:// origins, and the negotiating client - sharing one set of message types. Every response resumes the awaiting handler inline on its own reactor thread.",
